<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong><em>Important</em></strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><em>Margin trading involves a high degree of risk. Leverage can work against you as well as for you, and you can lose more than you put in. The value of the underlying security can also fall, which reduces the collateral available to you and can increase your risk of liquidation.</em></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
